    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "1.前往蒂娜村外小屋旁，白天与泰格利对话，选“是”进入海贼的巢穴。",
      "type": "timed-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "2.调查（24.8）处的书，选“是”获得【贝拉米的日记】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "3.调查（12.5）处的石头，选“是”获得【奇怪的符文】。与泰格利对话，离开海贼的巢穴。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "4.返回法兰城冒险者旅馆1楼，持有【贝拉米的日记】与【奇怪的符文】与大侦探汉克对话。（此步可跳过）",
      "type": "optional-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "5.前往芙蕾雅岛谢欧尔洞窟（699.197）与助手对话，交出【贝拉米的日记】获得【笔记鉴定信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "6.前往杰诺瓦镇医院2楼与除魔师亨特对话，交出【奇怪的符文】获得【符文解密信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "7.返回法兰城冒险者旅馆1楼与大侦探汉克对话，交出【笔记鉴定信】、【符文解密信】获得【祭坛调查令】。",
      "type": "combined-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
